{
  "5": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:28d7faba3a1d7e8aaa037ac9f7c72fde2a44a8ca2e6f8d52850319d4ffadb105",
      "text": "Interfaces, designs, functions I've\nnever seen... Otherworldly tech is\namazing! Mr. Alk!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "9": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:dd840f00bb55e1d19162d4376ea0bb2e496b696551efb4f05bebb124b4107af6",
      "text": "It really is. Glad I brought you.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "12": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e8d2b854ec297cec215df01b96ad8b696acb7467a237b07b2fea866e568cd090",
      "text": "You've got a good eye. How about\nthis weapon, then?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "16": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ac702ae406152eb506833b494c8b1f63d8df36ae39ac64835343a3834da48c11",
      "text": "—That's it, I've decided!\nI'll take every weapon on the shelf!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "20": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:63e8bfa2ce7c17efb2dcdf4e345d97cda50050c0aa80d4837b544ae988575a69",
      "text": "Whoa, whoa! Isn't that way too\nmuch?!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "24": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3f737cf26b1fba394eb8b635e4efd5a93a85f7c8561de4f9d3f2aea8f9f4ac8f",
      "text": "It's all expenses, so no problem!\nInvesting up front is essential for\ninventions!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "29": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:12e8857685bf5f6f5062ba5433f1e3235ceb248fe5ccd86ae53c0af41e6698e1",
      "text": "That's TOO MUCH!!\nResearch costs, material costs,\nupkeep... You spend like water...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "31": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:10155601096d164aa3da2a45fac5942ec833cf827489791c4b3c3afa67fb714a",
      "text": "At least use standard parts or go\nfor a general-purpose design. Think\nabout cost a little more—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "35": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fc5ced3dd7e02f75a7b77220475e367197fd503b6f977f9c9c488fde2ce09488",
      "text": "Saving and compromise are nonsense!\nThe coolest thing only exists on the\nfar side of total commitment!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "39": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a9b00573bbd3dd57ea0abf6f6c4470a191d422ee6f05d8edc501aec23dedc843",
      "text": "That's why heroes can entrust their\nlives to gadgets, and people go wild!\nIt leads to commercial success, too!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "42": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2a62821776133286e5beefe04a017fd2fe83366dda999a00b53ee27340cdcbc0",
      "text": "I'm talking about degree!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "44": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9dca37e85cfa54a894a08a975562eae18386992bccf5f2cb6853428fc27bd19f",
      "text": "Sigh... Honestly.\nThe boss is too soft...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "47": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3074087832d2652b6d695d4601280734c0894bafa625cb93aa3ab76a644c3749",
      "text": "...Well, making things under\nlimits has its own romance, doesn't\nit? I cook like that sometimes.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "51": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0a1916faafed9754a759af9303e067d186e0773b6e708712f8b5cc7dc220949c",
      "text": "Hm, you're on that side, Mr. Alk?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "54": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:885189a1c0657dfb7206fa82ed6c1e34aaf2ec7b95f91f6b612f4716bf453863",
      "text": "...Well, I know.\nBut I have to prove...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "58": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c7ed93359ee5f3a69fa1272cfed91ab2c11af815ad793294e7c0ddd65a234181",
      "text": "—N-no, it's nothing. It's just\nbetween me and myself.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "64": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b0f3c2aaea246e9559d058a449bc0bb8b0286903bab87d401a54231c89ca53b6",
      "text": "Dangerous driver on the highway.\nRespond ASAP~",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "71": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6ae0917503c8adcd6579a7cd879d64331bf4afe6b24d3dfc955c5790a231091f",
      "text": "—Perfect timing.\nI just updated my bike. Let's take it\nfor a test drive!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "76": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0e85dffb97c0e241e11db221eb908acdadcb7f6b78e97c94825614803e672eeb",
      "text": "—You won't get away!\nMr. Alk! Press the red button three\ntimes!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "80": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fe686f24bba00e4a9ebb58c251b6d67b8f09aafd496a47854a5d1566e7c6cca4",
      "text": "Waaaah!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "83": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:30a4fe3a29c16b446a8fcb019581e53436ea3a38e0848a71c3bb6524f7936d9e",
      "text": "You kept up with this Nitro Plasma\nEngine... You might have some\nspine.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "87": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9baa3be4697e2b20fa2161650ca11ec42b461c7ee7f9b6002e5974a111c52cf1",
      "text": "Of course! Hero Gadget No. 169 is\nno joke!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "89": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:aa8c84411ec3202a35e11555cab4dae6a8c952286d691ca0a1e58ddc24d53640",
      "text": "Homing missiles, hovering over\nwater, optical barriers... 77\nfeatures! Unlike ordinary machines—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "92": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bb51091c4f5862dffbb6c1d5557129592815e80dd4d951023f6e55ec93ef99a7",
      "text": "Hahaha!! \"The Strongest Bike I Made\nUp\"? That's a kid's toy idea!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "96": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1a3393e8dff4af3a384816d1fb9b46356ab30299690778ef54a95dd442457948",
      "text": "T-toy?! My ultimate cool...!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "99": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:853e30c7bbf237f0bbcfd169194d5803bc9bcca5e3f7086acf3e07e5ad629d7d",
      "text": "Stuffing it with useless junk.\n—I'll show you a ride that threw\neverything away for speed.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "101": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f790537ae8da249f0b56ba2fef9962e39404ff1a293a120c339aa9bea91306b3",
      "text": "Hahaha! Later, hobby kid!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "104": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:608b5dcaa73bed57290c0e09db44d8a3cfed700597f4db0dfa427dfffe4a6f2b",
      "text": "That guy...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "108": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ae3b96ae9e13100308c10fdfbfd36343c9fc104ba1d0111ab706b4c138668857",
      "text": "No good!\nAny more load and the reactor\nwill explode!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "112": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4bbf07be62dc70fba99ca5db39dc91a7becfbab96c769b649bdb2c0ecb72e9f3",
      "text": "But watch me...! Our cool... will\nnever lose...!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "118": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f2f3b524109e3a407c359c3b8feec911d39b2f94a421c34ab23699403f64b8f1",
      "text": "I brought a snack. You haven't\neaten dinner yet, have you?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "122": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:60b0ad52e3b704c47260a15b2522a504bd08b250cb60adc896546b81d891e48d",
      "text": "...Leave it over there. I have no\ntime to rest. I have to prove—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "126": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2ced6431e0dcf72da854b7f31bead362c63d6a491a095aaefa10b63142b9b252",
      "text": "Prove...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "130": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:87e6167274a012a7dc4e962c10358a2f27d0051aa8993710651349f3f550f2c9",
      "text": "I have a brother, five years older.\nWhen we were kids, we played hero\nand built gadgets. It was fun.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "133": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7ba5d06f8473ae216fb270965ae5415bcd95f184d7ade8cf95b81c64ae10237f",
      "text": "...But somewhere along the way he\ndiscarded cool. He turned into a\ncapitalist-pandering efficiency freak.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "137": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:924e846662a01edbc7444b120ebd9b487dc78861d245990e540ce232f92d29b2",
      "text": "Efficiency freak... Hmm, I see.\nSo that's why you're so particular\nabout being cool?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "141": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:aaef405d37398337e142fd13a1cf20ff7f65eae31034fd40fe1e1cc5d25cc7ff",
      "text": "I have to prove that our dreams\naren't unnecessary.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "145": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ac026d335b5ace6d49c4a2739c3a6e8c49ba0d1410603f1117481d10389dc46f",
      "text": "No, that our cool is superior to\neverything...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "149": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fa756c11cd36e7beffc6d35ad9d5209a3dfd408274c0c95ea24dfe9c8356075b",
      "text": "So, any chance of winning?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "153": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0c55534c8b98824754bd2e0a774cb4927fa70a140b1c3398f04026997ae55e72",
      "text": "...At least a Nitro Plasma Engine\nalone can't be that fast.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "156": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a80b0bb5ef350849c2f7332a55e21b14bd97fc6be59f6831875f24cde01374f9",
      "text": "It's just what you'd expect from\nthrowing out everything for speed.\nThat bike was functional beauty.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "159": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0f62c73700b3d38aa04528b3ebb3ec0770cff960febfe7a652b8d15e74a39019",
      "text": "...Why the weird face?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "163": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:cf4d78de351af721f0edc91def135233d4506a47a417f9b7077face00cd4b9dc",
      "text": "It's just that you praise him\nprecisely for someone you resent.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "168": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:163c49f4f6f0bc26b564523971fe9bedc8f7a4ea01ae8c3a94c7464259a4850f",
      "text": "T-that's... Technology isn't\nguilty, right?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "172": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8e98feb890fc8a0bdd1b5d574e4976047f1405eea944da7360cb1e9c0c76bd3c",
      "text": "...I see. But then your efficiency\nfreak brother has functional beauty\ntoo...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "177": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c93b25bc9dfefdc10c53b339679767488e66f3821d892e807ead08497fa43eec",
      "text": "Ugh... That's... I guess it does...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "180": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:46b072ea7d47277d6285c2a2c40a773890f8e5ebf4864c6e1935d0f71b137174",
      "text": "No, but it's not that. I'm against\npeople who deny romance... Wait, am\nI denying that bike's romance too?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "183": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:517857cefa9a4307f5b8639bb58bff4c85c48d36898f71a7fd3d6a39420cb340",
      "text": "Alk, answer honestly. From your\nside, am I a brother-complex...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "188": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:07c3e20ea8b6a1584274f53ea0ac9518d37647125f45ec7a06638452169ab91e",
      "text": "Well, um... No comment?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "194": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8d03ce55977450403feb92fa53d8ad4e40937f0401563279a0702e05c2814b26",
      "text": "WAAAAAAAAAH!!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "197": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ce76f6419448439797d5a9474db0984b45ad92134dbecd61d6743eb7459ca8fd",
      "text": "Am I an idiot...? Why didn't I\nnotice...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "200": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:277fac156be253d5d321f69704aab0a875260f4edb3d522b8d873a96c9eafd98",
      "text": "Technology isn't guilty. Everyone\nhas their own romance. It's only\nabout likes and dislikes...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "203": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:23f1de7c7b7af02b92f7ea7eae8505e9c39e652e978b3add939d596a038fdffa",
      "text": "I don't want to beat anyone or deny\nanyone.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "205": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:939d151767c3664f081f3c6364189be5d9b7674e9abd3731ef4b6a5d9db203e7",
      "text": "I just love making things and want\nto share that joy with everyone.\n...That's all.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "209": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4177a063757712d2072325ffa769d2f9babd1f21687559acafcb890f8ee85652",
      "text": "There's the usual you~",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "214": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:96da4ab5e47c16791b28e87ac9123ce6e063ef45e69478f39b7768fbaa6cff74",
      "text": "Yeah, thanks. And that's why I have\nto make them understand my romance!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "219": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:430aaa88e57c777fbf8e0d9f81ef46240e61ba79a22c54a3c7c87e154ede33f3",
      "text": "Hah, you never learn!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "222": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:923a563421726ad7abcf968a83264b278944c8dd70a3f7987498255f0c56a544",
      "text": "That bike is truly the coolest.\n—But we won't lose either!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "225": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:eb9ffb93ead28ecc3f2195da107ca60037de265b5e752a8b6f9f016219144b99",
      "text": "Let's clash our ultimate cools\nwith everything we've got!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  }
}
